coral-usb-hwmon (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package the standalone diagnostic probe in coral-usb-tools.
  * Read the configured clock and capture timestamped USB status samples.
  * Support an explicit snapshot of both HIB error registers.

 -- Dmitry Sidorov <jonmagon@gmail.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:00:00 +0300

